Error [E2903]: Performance budget binary is not valid
  --> tests/ui/perf_budget_wrong_unit_direction.jet:5:16
    |
  5 |         limit: .AtLeast(2ms),
    |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `BinarySize` and `Absolute` cannot use `.AtLeast`
 Fix: Use `.AtMost(...)` or relative `.RegressionAtMost(...)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2903

Error [E0101]: This program has no `run` function
 Why: Running a program starts at `fn run`, and the entry file doesn't define one
 Fix: Add `fn run() { ... }` to the entry file
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0101
